// A meta line closed by a bang or a question is empty.
// A bang on a real line stays. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE close ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG close law

IMPULSE close 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "close" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
